			<section id="lists" class="cm-section cm-section--pad">
				<SectionHead title="lists / rows" />

				<h3 class="cm-kicker">tree</h3>
				<p class="cm-head__sub">
					Expansion is the platform's &mdash; a <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> branch opens
					with no JavaScript and a summary is already focusable &mdash; so the runtime
					only walks it with the arrows: Down/Up step the visible rows, Right opens
					or steps inside, Left closes or steps out, Home/End jump. Indentation is
					nesting: each level pads its own children, so depth is never a style.
				</p>
