				<h3 class="cm-kicker">progress</h3>
				<p class="cm-head__sub">
					<code>cm-progress</code> is a linear bar. The fill is driven by the
					<code>--cm-progress</code> custom property, so a caller changes one
					value instead of the width &mdash; which keeps the transition, and keeps
					the track the full width for the eye to measure against. The
					element is a real <code>progressbar</code>: <code>aria-valuenow</code>
					stays the source of truth, and the fill only draws it.
				</p>
