							<button type="button" class="cm-seg__opt" aria-pressed="true">get</button>
							<button type="button" class="cm-seg__opt" aria-pressed="false">post</button>
							<button type="button" class="cm-seg__opt" aria-pressed="false">delete</button>
						</div>
						<span class="cm-field__help"><code>data-cm-seg="single"</code> keeps one pressed; <code>"multi"</code> toggles each. Without the attribute the runtime leaves <code>aria-pressed</code> to you.</span>
					</div>
					<details class="cm-disclosure">
