Four small parts a shadcn user reaches for first. <code>.cm-kbd</code> is a key, <code>.cm-pager</code> is real links with <code>aria-current</code>, <code>.cm-avatar</code> is a square tile that falls back to initials, and <code>.cm-accordion</code> is disclosures that close each other through the platform's own <code>name</code> attribute &mdash; no script.
