anchoring, <code>aria-expanded</code>, light dismiss and Escape are the popover machinery
this library already has - a composition should not ship a second copy of
its parts. What the composition DOES owe is the two things neither half
knows: the picked day belongs in the input (ISO, read back after the pick
so re-clicking the selected day clears it), and a completed pick closes
the panel while month navigation does not - paging is not a choice.
