			<section id="dropdown-depth" class="cm-section cm-section--pad">
				<SectionHead title="dropdown depth">
					the documented item kinds, all composing the same row: a
					submenu item owns a nested popover (Right or Enter opens,
					Left returns to the parent row), checkbox and radio items
					toggle in place and stay reachable by arrows, the shortcut
					hint is right-aligned and out of the accessible name, the
					leading icon slot is fixed width so labels hold one
					column, and typing jumps to the next item starting with
					those characters. group labels are composition only.
				</SectionHead>
				<div class="cm-spec">
					<div class="cm-spec__row">
						<span class="cm-spec__label">runtime</span>
						<span class="cm-spec__val">plain key handler - no per-menu init</span>
					</div>
					<div class="cm-spec__row">
						<span class="cm-spec__label">items</span>
						<span class="cm-spec__val">menuitem / menuitemcheckbox / menuitemradio, plus the submenu owner</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="cm-dropdown">
					<button type="button" class="cm-btn cm-btn--sm" popovertarget="menu-depth" aria-controls="menu-depth">actions</button>
					<div class="cm-dropdown__menu" id="menu-depth" popover role="menu" aria-label="file actions">
						<div class="cm-dropdown__group-label" id="grp-open" role="presentation">open with</div>
						<div role="group" aria-labelledby="grp-open">
							<button type="button" class="cm-dropdown__item" role="menuitem" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-controls="sub-depth-1">
								<span class="cm-dropdown__label"><span class="cm-dropdown__label-text">viewer</span></span>
								<span class="cm-dropdown__caret" aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
							</button>
							<div class="cm-dropdown__menu" id="sub-depth-1" popover role="menu" aria-label="viewer options">
								<button type="button" class="cm-dropdown__item" role="menuitem"><span class="cm-dropdown__label"><span class="cm-dropdown__label-text">read only</span></span></button>
								<button type="button" class="cm-dropdown__item" role="menuitem"><span class="cm-dropdown__label"><span class="cm-dropdown__label-text">annotate</span></span></button>
								<button type="button" class="cm-dropdown__item" role="menuitem"><span class="cm-dropdown__label"><span class="cm-dropdown__label-text">present</span></span></button>
							</div>
						</div>
						<hr class="cm-dropdown__sep" />
						<button type="button" class="cm-dropdown__item" role="menuitemcheckbox" aria-checked="true" data-cm-check>
							<span class="cm-dropdown__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-checked="true"></span>
							<span class="cm-dropdown__label"><span class="cm-dropdown__label-text">show invisibles</span></span>
							<span class="cm-dropdown__shortcut" aria-hidden="true">ctrl i</span>
						</button>
						<button type="button" class="cm-dropdown__item" role="menuitemcheckbox" aria-checked="false" data-cm-check>
							<span class="cm-dropdown__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-checked="false"></span>
							<span class="cm-dropdown__label"><span class="cm-dropdown__label-text">wrap columns</span></span>
						</button>
						<div class="cm-dropdown__group-label" id="grp-dens" role="presentation">density</div>
						<div role="group" aria-labelledby="grp-dens">
							<button type="button" class="cm-dropdown__item" role="menuitemradio" aria-checked="true" data-cm-radio="density">
								<span class="cm-dropdown__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span class="cm-dropdown__label"><span class="cm-dropdown__label-text">comfortable</span></span>
							</button>
							<button type="button" class="cm-dropdown__item" role="menuitemradio" aria-checked="false" data-cm-radio="density">
								<span class="cm-dropdown__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span class="cm-dropdown__label"><span class="cm-dropdown__label-text">compact</span></span>
							</button>
						</div>
						<hr class="cm-dropdown__sep" />
