					<code>legend</code> per item, a named progressbar, native radio and
					checkbox keyboard, a freeform answer beside the fixed choices,
					letter shortcuts, an explicit skip on optional items, and a submit
					that validates every required item - jumping to the first
					offender - then toasts and wipes with a full
					<code>form.reset()</code>. Failed validation focuses an answer
					control; successful navigation focuses the new legend.
				</SectionHead>
				<div class="cm-spec">
					<div class="cm-spec__row">
						<span class="cm-spec__label">runtime</span>
						<span class="cm-spec__val">data-cm-quiz (init + late-markup observer)</span>
